# Facet shards (reports/render-features/2026-11-11-facet-shards): the hero's own head close to the camera with the
# sun at noon in the Khorinis market and with the candle of the harbour house, then the city at a low sun and the
# lamps at night. Every view as shots of one camera: `-old` the shadow test as before 2026-11-11 (`vsm study 1` for
# the sun, `2` for the lamps), `-new` the game's, `-old2` the old one again (the world does not stand still between
# shots: what differs between the two old ones is not the fix), `-class` the facets by their cosine to the light,
# `-diff` (the sun) where the fix changes the shadow in that very frame.
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 OPENGOTHIC_LIGHT_FREEZE=1 BENCH_HOST=ryzen OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<content with the head> \
#     scripts/bench.sh facet-shards <out>
#   python reports/render-features/2026-11-11-facet-shards/tools/pairs.py <out>
# @timeout 900
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
cam cut
# 1. The sun at noon in the face, close and at a talk's distance
set time 12 0
